IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. AIDCALC.
* BATCH GENERAL EDUCATION AID CALCULATION
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT DISTRICT-FILE ASSIGN TO DISTIN
        ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL.
    SELECT PAYMENT-FILE ASSIGN TO PAYOUT
        ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD  DISTRICT-FILE.
COPY AIDREC.
FD  PAYMENT-FILE.
01  PAYMENT-LINE              PIC X(80).
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-EOF                    PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    88  END-OF-FILE             VALUE 'Y'.
01  WS-RATE                   PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 7138.00.
01  WS-COUNT                  PIC 9(7) VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN SECTION.
0000-START.
    OPEN INPUT DISTRICT-FILE
         OUTPUT PAYMENT-FILE
    PERFORM 1000-READ-DISTRICT
    PERFORM 2000-CALC-AID UNTIL END-OF-FILE
    CALL 'AIDAUDIT' USING WS-COUNT
    CLOSE DISTRICT-FILE PAYMENT-FILE
    GOBACK.
1000-READ-DISTRICT.
    READ DISTRICT-FILE
        AT END SET END-OF-FILE TO TRUE
    END-READ.
2000-CALC-AID.
    COMPUTE AID-TOTAL-AMOUNT = AID-STUDENT-COUNT * WS-RATE
        * (1 + AID-ADJUST-PCT / 100)
    ADD 1 TO WS-COUNT
    MOVE AID-DISTRICT-ID TO PAYMENT-LINE
    WRITE PAYMENT-LINE
    PERFORM 1000-READ-DISTRICT.
